  "instructions": [
    "In a wok, heat the vegetable oil over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the thai green curry paste and stir-fry for about 30 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Stir in nuka-pickle, tamarind paste, minced ginger, scallions, tomato sauce or puree, soy sauce, and lime juice. Mix well.",
    "Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer for about 15 minutes.",
    "Add cubed chicken or tofu to the curry and let cook until heated through (about 10-12 minutes).",
    "Garnish with fresh scallions if desired.",
    "Serve over cooked rice."
